d":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3065523106,"text":"フュシリエはエドウィンを尊敬してたの？","nextNodeIds":[741361209]},{"nodeId":741361209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5257,"speakerName":"レモンド","textMapHash":3881957290,"text":"…エドウィン·イースティングハウスは天才だ。彼と同じ分野で働いた人間は自暴自棄になるか、その信者になる。","nextNodeIds":[741361210]},{"nodeId":741361210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5257,"speakerName":"レモンド","textMapHash":1856835906,"text":"フュシリエさんは情熱と創意にあふれた研究員だ。しばしば小さなコストで素晴らしい成果を出していた。","nextNodeIds":[741361211]},{"nodeId":741361211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5257,"speakerName":"レモンド","textMapHash":356546618,"text":"彼女はアルケウム研究プロジェクトの第三技術班に入ってから、抑制機の構造設計に携わり、エドウィンと何度も交流する機会があった。","nextNodeIds":[741361212]},{"nodeId":741361212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5257,"speakerName":"レモンド","textMapHash":2346774610,"text":"彼女はその時、エドウィンの信者になったのかもしれない。他の信者と同じく、エドウィンに認められることが彼女の唯一の目標となった。","nextNodeIds":[741361213]},{"nodeId":741361213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5257,"speakerName":"レモンド","textMapHash":2429701066,"text":"爆発後、彼女はエドウィンが犯人だと信じようとせず、自ら調査に参加し、エドウィンの無実を勝ち取ろうとした。","nextNodeIds":[741361214]},{"nodeId":741361214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5257,"speakerName":"レモンド","textMapHash":1201114514,"text":"君もエドウィンと話しただろう、どんな印象を受けた？","nextNodeIds":[741361215]},{"nodeId":741361215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2067712938,"text":"研究以外には目もくれないマッドサイエンティストだったな！責任を他人になすりつけて、フュシリエの名前も覚えてなかったぞ！","nextNodeIds":[741361216]},{"nodeId":741361216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5257,"speakerName":"レモンド","textMapHash":67716146,"text":"そう、彼はそんな人間なんだ。目の前の研究以外、あらゆる物や人にほぼ目もくれない。","nextNodeIds":[741361217]},{"nodeId":741361217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5257,"speakerName":"レモンド","textMapHash":988550314,"text":"研究さえ上手くいけば、他のことはどうだって構わないんだ。部下の研究員がこっそり研究資産を転売していようがね。","nextNodeIds":[741361218]},{"nodeId":741361218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5257,"speakerName":"レモンド","textMapHash":1663170906,"text":"フュシリエさんの調査の参加を許したのは…単に彼女に早く分かってほしかっただけだ。自分はずっと、想像の中の幻影を追いかけてるんだってね。","nextNodeIds":[741361219]},{"nodeId":741361219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5257,"speakerName":"レモンド","textMapHash":2818778106,"text":"ついに幻想は消え去った。彼女が早く元気になってくれるといいんだが…フォンテーヌ科学院は、これ以上研究員を失うわけにはいかないからね。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":741361220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4117978002,"text":"さようなら。","nextNodeIds":[741361221]},{"nodeId":741361221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5257,"speakerName":"レモンド","textMapHash":2657828122,"text":"ああ、さよなら。名誉上級研究員。","nextNodeIds":[]}]},{"talkId":7413613,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":true,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","beginCond":[{"param":["7413611","3","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_N